(158,55,9,'<p><strong>Español:</strong></p><p>Siempre estamos innovando y nos enorgullece compartir que fuimos reconocidos con el premio FABI Awards gracias a nuestra salsa Beetroot Habanero Sauce.</p><p>Invitamos a todos a acompañarnos en este gran evento en Chicago y conocer más sobre este importante reconocimiento de la industria gastronómica.</p><p>Más información del evento: <a href=\"https://www.nationalrestaurantshow.com/home/fabi-awards/?utm_source=chatgpt.com#judges\" target=\"_blank\">FABI Awards - National Restaurant Show</a></p><p>Nos vemos en la siguiente ubicación:</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>En ingles:</strong></p><p>Innovation is at the heart of everything we do, and we’re proud to announce that our Beetroot Habanero Sauce has been honored with a prestigious FABI Award.</p><p>We invite everyone to join us at this extraordinary event in Chicago, where culinary innovation and bold flavors come together to shape the future of the food industry.</p><p>Discover more about the event here: <a href=\"https://www.nationalrestaurantshow.com/home/fabi-awards/?utm_source=chatgpt.com#judges\" target=\"_blank\">FABI Awards - National Restaurant Show</a></p><p>We look forward to welcoming you at the following location:</p>',NULL,'2026-05-07 17:31:14','2026-05-07 17:31:14'),
