(208,55,1,'<p>El cliente ha enviado el texto:</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Proud to be a</p><p>FABI AWARD</p><p>AWARDEE</p><p><br></p><p>We’re proud to share that our Beetroot Habanero Sauce has been recognized with a 2026 FABI Award, one of the foodservice industry’s leading honors for innovation.</p><p>This recognition reflects our commitment to creating sauces that bring bold flavor, visual impact, and real menu versatility to operators looking for something different.</p><p>Join us at the National Restaurant Show in Chicago to taste Beetroot Habanero Sauce and explore our full line of sauces.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>But that’s not all!</p><p><br></p><p>Visit us at booth #12723 to taste our full line of sauces and discover bold, versatile flavors made for today’s foodservice menus.</p>',NULL,'2026-05-14 18:47:57','2026-05-14 18:47:57'),
