(223,75,9,'<p> Subject: <strong>Looking for Reliable Mexico–USA Transportation Capacity?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Good afternoon,</p><p>My name is Rocio Velez, Director of Transportation at <a href=\"https://absolute-fi.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\">Absolute Group</a>. In Laredo, TX</p><p>I wanted to take a moment to introduce our company and share the transportation solutions we provide throughout Mexico and the United States.</p><p>Absolute Group is an asset-based carrier specializing in cross-border logistics, dedicated transportation, and automotive supply chain operations. Our team focuses on operational visibility, communication, and reliable service for time-sensitive freight.</p><p>Our capabilities include:</p><ul><li>Cross-border transportation (MX–USA)</li><li>Door-to-door logistics solutions</li><li>Dedicated capacity</li><li>Trailer pools</li><li>Dry van operations</li><li>Automotive and electric components freight expertise</li><li>Real-time tracking and operational visibility</li></ul><p>I am attaching our company information and would appreciate the opportunity to connect and explore how we may support your transportation needs.</p><p>Thank you for your time, and I look forward to hearing from you.</p><p>Best regards,</p><p>Rocio Velez</p><p>Director of Transportation</p><p>Absolute Group</p><p>Laredo, Texas</p><p><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4e7/32.png\" alt=\"📧\">&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:rocio@absolute-fi.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\">rocio@absolute-fi.com</a></p><p><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f310/32.png\" alt=\"🌐\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://absolute-fi.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\">www.absolute-fi.com</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>En español:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Buenas tardes,</p><p>Mi nombre es Rocio Velez, Directora de Transporte de <a href=\"https://absolute-fi.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\">Absolute Group</a>. En Laredo, TX</p><p>Me gustaría tomar un momento para presentarles nuestra empresa y compartir las soluciones de transporte que ofrecemos entre México y Estados Unidos.</p><p>Absolute Group es una empresa asset-based especializada en logística cross-border, transporte dedicado y operaciones para la industria automotriz. Nuestro enfoque principal es brindar visibilidad operativa, comunicación constante y servicio confiable para cargas sensibles al tiempo.</p><p>Algunas de nuestras capacidades incluyen:</p><ul><li>Transporte cross-border (México–USA)</li><li>Soluciones door-to-door</li><li>Capacidad dedicada</li><li>Trailer pools</li><li>Operaciones dry van</li><li>Experiencia en carga automotriz y componentes electricos</li><li>Rastreo y visibilidad en tiempo real</li></ul><p>Adjunto información de nuestra compañía y quedo a sus órdenes para explorar oportunidades de colaboración y apoyar sus necesidades de transporte.</p><p>Muchas gracias por su tiempo.</p><p>Saludos cordiales,</p><p>Rocio Velez</p><p>Director of Transportation</p><p>Absolute Group</p><p>Laredo, Texas</p><p><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4e7/32.png\" alt=\"📧\">&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:rocio@absolute-fi.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\">rocio@absolute-fi.com</a></p><p><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f310/32.png\" alt=\"🌐\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://absolute-fi.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\">www.absolute-fi.com</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2026-05-25 15:08:11','2026-05-25 15:08:11'),
