(44,'Reel del sensor Q4X de Banner','<p>Producción de reel educativo del sensor Q4X de banner para redes sociales (Tiktok, Youtube, LinkedIn, Instagram y Facebook) , mediante el uso de material B-Roll, integración de voiceover, edición de video y animación de textos en pantalla por escena.</p><p><br></p><p>Links:<a href=\" https://www.bannerengineering.com/mx/es/solutions/quality-control/detecting-black-parts-on-black-door-panel.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.bannerengineering.com/mx/es/solutions/quality-control/detecting-black-parts-on-black-door-panel.html</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.bannerengineering.com/mx/es/products/sensors/photoelectric-sensors/q4x-laser-distance-sensor.html?srsltid=AfmBOopl1NEDLrmoz-jMmW0C53Hnp-tVSZKfM_wS2TNyZXFAKQW46rVe#/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.bannerengineering.com/mx/es/products/sensors/photoelectric-sensors/q4x-laser-distance-sensor.html?srsltid=AfmBOopl1NEDLrmoz-jMmW0C53Hnp-tVSZKfM_wS2TNyZXFAKQW46rVe#/</a></p><p><br></p>','Media','Completados','support',47,74,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-05 19:39:03','2026-05-04 19:14:52','2026-05-05 19:39:03',16,16,NULL,0,'2026-05-04 19:14:48','2026-05-05 19:39:03',NULL),
